		(descr "Tail-end lands of band tail FLEX1 that mate with J_BAND_A: same land centres seen on the tail (outer face F.Cu), land 0.30 along the tail x 0.30 across, ENIG, coverlay opening 0.40 x 0.40. Tail frame: x = u along the tail from the end that goes under the board, y = -v with v = X + 2.5. Origin at u 0.90, v 0.25 (middle of the foot). Source: design/ecad/band/band-interface.md sections 2 and 3.")
